@TravelCRM.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5030
@token = replace-with-a-valid-jwt
@bookingId = 1
@paymentId = 1

### List payments with filters and pagination
GET {{TravelCRM.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Payments?status=Completed&method=Cash&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Booking payment history and server-calculated totals
GET {{TravelCRM.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Payments/booking/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Record a pending payment
POST {{TravelCRM.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": {{bookingId}},
  "amount": 100.00,
  "paymentType": "Advance",
  "paymentMethod": "UPI",
  "paymentStatus": "Pending",
  "paymentDate": "2026-11-07T12:00:00Z",
  "transactionReference": "MANUAL-EXAMPLE",
  "notes": "Example only"
}

### Complete or fail a pending payment
PATCH {{TravelCRM.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Payments/{{paymentId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed"
}

### Dashboard payment metrics by currency
GET {{TravelCRM.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Payments/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
